# Analyzer Architecture

Coming soon — this page explains the Roslyn analyzers that ship with
Reactor (`REACTOR_THEME_*`, `REACTOR_A11Y_*`, `REACTOR_GRID_001`,
`REACTOR_FUNC_001`, `REACTOR_PERSIST_001`, plus the doc-system
`REACTOR_DOC_*` family): how each is wired, where the diagnostics
live, and how to author one for your own conventions. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Styling](styling.md) and
[Accessibility](accessibility.md) reference these diagnostics from
the surface side.
